<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells dollars at PLN 3.4562 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells dollars at PLN 3.4562 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) sold dollars on the interbank market at 3.4562 zlotys, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1200 GMT when the zloty was around 1.50 percent below the dollar/mark parity rate -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
